    "description": "Free browser-based web application for multi-objective Pareto analysis of drug-like molecules. Computes physicochemical properties with RDKit.js (WebAssembly, client-side), identifies Pareto-optimal subsets, and provides interactive analysis views. Optional ADMET predictions via ADMET-AI (Chemprop D-MPNN).",
